Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:53.32,Title-207-,,0,0,290,,{\fad(700,0)\bord2\3c&H141414&\c&H141414&\blur0.5\1a&HFF&\t(655,700,\1a&H00&)}Enter: Tony Tony Chopper
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:53.32,Title-207-,,0,0,290,,{\fad(700,0)\c&HE6E6E6&\bord0\blur0.5\4a&HFF&}Enter: Tony Tony Chopper
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you've got it backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.21,0:02:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hiding thing, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's a little late at this\Npoint, and I can still see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and can you tell me\Nhow your fever's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's choking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.53,0:02:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it down, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fever seems to have\Ngone down a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.99,0:02:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's gone down several degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only doctor\Naround here. Dr. Kureha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:03:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can call me Dr. Rain, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, then that means we're on...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for how I stay so young?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, yes, you're in the\Ncastle on the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, there were two other people\Nwho showed up here with me, weren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.77,0:03:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're sleeping in the next room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two real tough guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.21,0:03:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what caused your sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were bitten by a kestia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a poisonous tick that thrives in\Njungles with high heat and humidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it bites you, it introduces\Na type of bacteria into your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These bacteria lay dormant for\Nfive days, causing severe pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It causes a high fever, a severe\Ninfection, myocarditis, and arteritis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given the infection's\Nprogression in the affected area,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd guess you'd been infected\Nfor about three days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:04:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain you'd been feeling\Nmust have been terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but still it would have eased up in two\Nmore days without any treatment at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have gone away\Nin two days? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.19,0:04:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be feeling any pain\Nwhatsoever because you'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This particular infection is\Nknown as the five-day disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.47,0:04:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had heard that Kestia had died\Nout over a hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I kept the antibiotic just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.83,0:04:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you guys come from that\Nyou may have been exposed to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you walking around some ancient\Njungle with your belly showing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.05,0:04:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.55,0:04:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.03,0:04:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this situation sound familiar at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a crazy girl you are, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, stay in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The treatment for the disease\Nisn't completely finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine as long\Nas my fever goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.13,0:04:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body will take care\Nof itself after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you an optimistic one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This disease normally takes a course of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,treatment ten days long\Nto successfully cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:05:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with medicines as\Nadvanced as mine are,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your body will still need at least\Nthree days to fully recuperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to risk more suffering\Nand possibly death, get some rest, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stay that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get Vivi\Nhome, back to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a patient leaves this castle, it's\Nbecause she's either cured or deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't going anywhere, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.47,0:05:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He climbed this mountain\Nwith his bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's almost three miles\Nof sheer rock to go up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:06:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His entire body is on\Nthe brink of frostbite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.17,0:06:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was he thinking dressing\Nlike that for such a climb?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Draw some hot water and throw him into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is bleeding a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has six broken ribs\Nand a spinal fissure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I operate on him, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,E?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently the most critical of\Nour three patients is this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.57,0:06:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have phenocall, cardiotonic,\Nand thiosaline ready for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has an infection?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and the infection isn't\Nfrom anywhere on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make the bleeding kid\Nand the sick girl better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can rest easy, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are my friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.09,0:06:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save them, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.49,0:06:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, let's begin treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:07:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are my friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A venison stew should be\Nsimmered in a large pot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for three hours until all\Nthe meat becomes tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Venison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Luffy, let me\Ncook this guy up first!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.01,0:08:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like you're all better!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.49,0:08:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting there, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One tasty venison dish for Nami coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.27,0:08:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are already up and moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.65,0:08:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me about this talking deer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figured you'd ask about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.93,0:08:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't run away, meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't eat it yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.77,0:08:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a reindeer with\Na blue nose, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But normal reindeers don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's different from ordinary\Nreindeers in some way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's different?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not food for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's different, it's just because he\Nate a human, human fruit, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.01,0:09:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human-human fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.70,0:09:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still a reindeer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now he has the abilities of a\Nhuman, like talking and walking abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And also, he's a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I taught Chopper everything that I\Nknow about the field of medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.65,0:09:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Already over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was disappointing, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.75,0:09:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, that was a good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I told you to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.01,0:09:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can go over there\Nand look for Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.69,0:09:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Dig everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.89,0:10:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they all so worked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.23,0:10:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it all to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, let's just give them a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be one of my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really need to have a doctor on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.51,0:10:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, did you just call\Nme old lady? Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did, old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd be a little\Nmore careful of what I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.93,0:10:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still well within my\Nyouthful 130s, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're a tough old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you boys really asking\Nme to become a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.97,0:10:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be an incredible\Nwaste of my precious time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I have no interest\Nin life on the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are all lame excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:10:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about adventure, old lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:10:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this one's a slow learner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.03,0:11:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I just tell you\Nto watch what you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these guys are pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here! Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough of that, idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.09,0:11:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In just a few minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to cook you a delicious\Nreindeer dish you'll never forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll eat you guys first\Nbefore I let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.59,0:11:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want some peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that shouldn't be inside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.27,0:12:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you need to stay in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you still have a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.49,0:12:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like it's pretty much gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least for now. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ene's medicine works\Nquickly to reduce the fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the bacteria from\Nthe castile will still
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remain inside your body\Nfor a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just take your antibiotic\Nshot and stay in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.59,0:12:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's been\Ntaking care of me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't eat thanks from you\Nor any other low-life human!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mock me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind that, I'm just being silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, seriously, I'm being such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.09,0:12:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not so good at hiding his emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.53,0:13:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This castle is really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold and filled with snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.61,0:13:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the sharpest knife in\Nthe drawer, are you, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.59,0:13:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's snow everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.13,0:13:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look, all the doors to the\Nunused rooms are frozen shut too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here in just a moment, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:14:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should rethink this idea about\Nasking the old hag to join our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.19,0:14:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real doctor doesn't\Nchase her patients around
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.19,0:14:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a freaky snow-filled\Ncastle trying to kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.65,0:14:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you guys are pirates? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's real pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.43,0:14:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you have a flag with a skull on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do, it's on our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.83,0:14:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're really\Ninterested in pirates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all! You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.27,0:14:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.55,0:14:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could come sail with\Nus, out on the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you did, that would\Nreally help me out a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we had a doctor on this ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.03,0:14:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I wouldn't have to stay\Nin this place three more days,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you'd have a really\Ngood time if you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize I'm a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't belong on a ship\Nwith a bunch of humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, just look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.57,0:15:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer, but I walk on two\Nlegs and I talk and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Animals aren't supposed to\Nbe able to do that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I know, but if you're trying\Nto scare me off, it isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.05,0:15:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have a blue nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, Reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those brats sure can run, can't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't much like what you\Nwere doing there, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to tempt my reindeer away\Nfrom me without my permission
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your permission to make\Na move on a man all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I suppose you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to take him\Naway from here, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I must warn you, it won't\Nbe as easy as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:15:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper has a scar on his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:16:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A deep one my medicine can't cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the moment he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, including his parents,\Nturned their backs on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.35,0:16:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All because he was born with a blue nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was forced to walk at\Nthe back of the group,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,separated from the rest of the reindeer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though he was just\Na helpless newborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.41,0:16:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then one day he ate a Devil Fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.67,0:16:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he became even more of an\Noutcast than he had been before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.53,0:16:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other reindeer pressured\Nhim to leave the herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.05,0:16:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His blue nose already made him different,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now he wasn't like the\Nordinary reindeer at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, he was lonely and wanted friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he went down to a village\Nwalking on two legs, as humans do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is that creature over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.67,0:16:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even walking on two legs, he\Ndidn't look anything like the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:17:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for some reason, his\Nnose was still blue as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.09,0:17:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a yeti.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.41,0:17:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the children inside, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gun! Bring me a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.39,0:17:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, before he runs\Naway! Get him! Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.99,0:17:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from us, freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't know what was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't understand\Nwhy they reacted to his
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,appearance with so much fear\Nand anger stay away, monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd gone to the village\Nseeking friends but
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they called him a monster\Nand drove him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was no longer a reindeer but he wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.39,0:17:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a human either he was\Nsomething in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so he lived alone after that caught\Nbetween two worlds that wouldn't accept him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:18:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've heard his story do you\Nthink you can heal the scar on his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, check out the door\Nat the front entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wide open. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's so cold in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's close it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With it open like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.23,0:18:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's not much difference between\Ninside and outside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.77,0:18:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's close it, or we're\Ngoing to freeze to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you guys hear what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he so angry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.21,0:18:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come over here a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bunch of baby snowbirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, if we closed the door, they'd fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.95,0:19:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's the reason\Nthey're leaving it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.79,0:19:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up a sec. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That weird reindeer guy,\Nwasn't he speaking earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I remember\Nhim walking on two legs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.69,0:19:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He walks upright and talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has fur. He's little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And becomes big.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a cool guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.55,0:20:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's really interesting!\NHey, wait! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should join us!

